# Comment Rules

See `docs/COMMENTS.md`.

## MUST

- Prefer why-comments over what-comments
- Put empty lines around standalone comments (with block start/end exceptions)
- Place JSDoc directly above declarations (no blank line between)

## MUST NOT

- Leave large commented-out dead code
- Restate the next line of code in a comment
